type GalaxyShape="spiral"|"elliptical"|"ring"|"clusters";type GalaxyDensity="sparse"|"normal"|"dense";type StartMode="balanced"|"random"|"clustered";type Frequency="low"|"normal"|"high";type GalaxySettings={size:number;ai:number;shape:GalaxyShape;spiralArms:2|4|6;density:GalaxyDensity;guaranteedWorlds:0|1|2;startMode:StartMode;habitability:Frequency;anomalies:Frequency;gateways:Frequency;primitives:Frequency};
